  <content styleCode="bold">C37</content>on the other side.

 </paragraph>
                        <paragraph>NDC 48433-017-20 – Unit dose blister packages 
  <br/>  of 100 (10 cards of 10 tablets each).
 </paragraph>
                        <paragraph>
